WEBVTT

00:02:55.913 --> 00:03:01.454
I mean, vulnerability is very simply
defined as uncertainty,

00:03:01.621 --> 00:03:03.788
risk and emotional exposure.

00:03:04.329 --> 00:03:09.329
It's the affect or emotion we feel in
times of great uncertainty, risk.

00:03:09.329 --> 00:03:12.246
And when an emotional exposure just
means I put myself out there.

00:03:13.288 --> 00:03:16.829
And so the first thing we have
to do is dispel that notion.

00:03:17.579 --> 00:03:20.371
We are raised to believe it's
important to be brave,

00:03:20.663 --> 00:03:24.913
but then we're taught not to be vulnerable
. And they're really.

00:03:25.954 --> 00:03:28.996
In my you know, based on my
research and our data,

00:03:29.038 --> 00:03:31.621
there just is no courage
without vulnerability.